                <invention-title lang="de">VORRICHTUNG UND VERFAHREN FÜR EINE VERBESSERTE KAFFEEMASCHINE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">APPAREIL ET PROCÉDÉ POUR UNE CAFETIÈRE AMÉLIORÉE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">APPARATUS AND METHOD FOR AN IMPROVED COFFEE MAKER</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A coffee making device has a body with a drip tray and a removeable water tank that supplies water to a heat system of the device. The water tank is internal to the device and removeable by a user. The body has a fluid refill opening that leads to the tank. The tank includes a overflow channel or conduit that dispenses into the drip tray.</p>
